		MESSAGE
		{
			title = Contract Complete
			message = <b>Science data from space around Minmus.</b>~n~nWe've just received experimental data from space around Minmus! Good work.~n~n<b><color=#8BED8B>Completion Rewards:</color></b> ~n<color=#B4D455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  50,560   </color>~n<color=#6DCFF6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 3   </color>~n<color=#E0D503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 5   </color>~n~n
			color = 2
			icon = 3
			read = False
		}
		MESSAGE
		{
			title = World First Milestones
			message = The recent accomplishments of our space program have attracted contributions from numerous organizations!~n~nWe have gathered the first scientific data from The Sun.~n<color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1> 9,120 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 1 </color>~n~n We have returned to the surface from orbit.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  12,000 </color><color=#6dcff6><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Science" tint=1> 1 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 2 </color>~n~n We have performed an EVA test at home.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  1,600 </color>~n~n We have planted the first one of our flags at home.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  1,600 </color>~n~n We have recovered our first crew from a mission.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  800 </color>~n~n We have escaped the gravitational influence of The Mun.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  9,360 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 1 </color>~n~n We have escaped the gravitational influence of Minmus.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  10,440 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 1 </color>~n~n We have returned home from a fly by of Minmus.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  14,500 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 1 </color>~n~n We have returned home from a fly by of The Mun.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  13,000 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 1 </color>~n~n We have returned home from orbit of The Mun.~n <color=#b4d455><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Funds" tint=1>  12,480 </color><color=#e0d503><sprite="CurrencySpriteAsset" name="Reputation" tint=1> 1 </color>~n
